        <mxCell id="c3" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:11px;color:#5A6375&quot;&gt;Who uses IMT and which external systems it reads from or talks to. IMT runs offline; nothing leaves the machine unless the user starts a download, an update or a web search in the docked browser.&lt;/span&gt;" style="fontFamily=Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#1B2130;fontSize=11;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
